    "detailed_description": "<h1>Custom Maps</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes <strong>full Steam Workshop integration</strong>. Publish or download custom maps through the Steam Workshop or import maps directly from your local files.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >History remembers emperors\u2026 but plagues remember no one. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dying Reign</i>, you are the last force stopping your empire's collapse. Govern through chaos, adapt to evolving threats, and hold your people together as history\u2019s deadliest pandemics unfold.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dying Reign</i> is a minimalist  strategy game where a handful of nodes represent your empire where every choice you make could save or doom your reign. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your empire from collapsing by balancing your empire's stats.  Every decision affects your empire differently, and managing these interconnected systems is the key to survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morale</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spread Rate</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional\u00a0Allegiance</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over a dozen events: an economic boom, banditry, cultural revivals, scandals, natural disasters, and more. Every event shifts the balance of power, morale, economy, and stability. These aren\u2019t just random, they react to your empire\u2019s current state and force you to adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Maps Across Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead empires through five distinct eras of crisis:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Athens, 429 BCE</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Byzantine Empire, 529</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Roman Empire, 1347</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roman Empire, 248</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qing Dynasty, 1854</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Advisors </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock key figures to help you govern. Advisors stay hidden until earned through gameplay, and each one adds unique benefits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >History remembers emperors\u2026 but plagues remember no one. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Dying Reign</i>, you are the last force stopping your empire's collapse. Govern through chaos, adapt to evolving threats, and hold your people together as history\u2019s deadliest pandemics unfold.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dying Reign</i> is a minimalist  strategy game where a handful of nodes represent your empire where every choice you make could save or doom your reign. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Your Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your empire from collapsing by balancing your empire's stats.  Every decision affects your empire differently, and managing these interconnected systems is the key to survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stability</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Morale</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spread Rate</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional\u00a0Allegiance</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face over a dozen events: an economic boom, banditry, cultural revivals, scandals, natural disasters, and more. Every event shifts the balance of power, morale, economy, and stability. These aren\u2019t just random, they react to your empire\u2019s current state and force you to adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Maps Across Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead empires through five distinct eras of crisis:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Athens, 429 BCE</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Byzantine Empire, 529</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Holy Roman Empire, 1347</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roman Empire, 248</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Qing Dynasty, 1854</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Advisors </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock key figures to help you govern. Advisors stay hidden until earned through gameplay, and each one adds unique benefits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
